# Module 8 — environment notes
#
# Most of this module needs NO .env of its own:
#   * Day 1 (compare-prompts.yaml) runs on local Ollama — nothing to configure
#     beyond having Ollama running and the two models pulled.
#   * Day 2's trip agent gets its model/credentials from MODULE 7's own file:
#     module-07-deepeval-agent-testing/trip_agent/.env  (Azure DeepSeek here).
#     The provider (trip_provider.py) just imports that agent.
#
# The only thing Promptfoo needs to know is which Python to run the custom
# provider with — set this in your SHELL before `promptfoo eval`, not in a .env:
#
#   export PROMPTFOO_PYTHON=../../.venv/bin/python   # from the examples/ dir
#
# Optional: point Promptfoo's native Ollama provider at a non-default host
# (used as the llm-rubric judge and by the Day 1 models). Default is fine locally.
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# Optional: silence Promptfoo telemetry.
# PROMPTFOO_DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1
